# release-signers - the keys install.sh trusts for release signatures (SEC-07), in ssh-keygen
# allowed_signers format: principal, options, key. assemble.sh embeds this file into install.sh.
#
# Every line: principal mc-panel-release, namespaces="mc-panel-release". A key line may carry
# valid-after="YYYYMMDD" / valid-before="YYYYMMDD" (rotation, docs/dev/README.md "Release
# signing"). Removing a line revokes the key for every install.sh released after that.
